  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The given equation is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msup><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math><br />or <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></msup><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math><br />Integrating, we get,</p><p>&nbsp;<math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></msup><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi></math><br />Or <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p>",
